    m_Localized: Collectable
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143484961328279552
    m_Localized: 'Listen carefully: You are stuck in a cursed apartment, and it''s full of <color=#962433>anomalies.</color>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143485051363209216
    m_Localized: If you want to get out - capture <color=#962433>anomalies</color> with your camera and get to the <color=#26bf21>elevator</color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143485081356677120
    m_Localized: If you miss an <color=#962433>anomaly</color> - the <color=#26bf21>elevator</color> will glitch and take you back to the highest floor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143485106178568192
    m_Localized: Be aware that <color=#962433>monsters</color> are not anomalies. Good luck.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
