  - m_Id: 146543352669876224
    m_Localized: '<color=#ff0000>Anomalies</color> can be <color=#ff0000>missing</color> or <color=#ff0000>anomalous</color> objects. Living inhabitants, sounds, significant environment changes, ‘red room’, medkits or collectables are not <color=#ff0000>anomalies</color>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147793826500915200
    m_Localized: Every floor is identical. Remember details. Any change in floor is <color=#ff0000>anomaly</color>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 148229115379789824
    m_Localized: "Press up when there's <color=#ff0000>anomaly</color> on this floor\n Press down when there's no <color=#ff0000>anomaly</color>"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 148229147633987584
    m_Localized: If there is <color=#ff0000>anomaly</color>, capture it with your camera to remove it
